a75a-e85fafd71c50","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"へぇー、気になります","ts":"1634832080.066700","thread_ts":"1634813105.017100","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ENPb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd81d2d2-ade2-4d4a-a343-de65c9374c54","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"例えば、状態を復元したり前の候補に戻したりアクションを候補として実行できるのもUIと分離してるからです","ts":"1634832304.067000","thread_ts":"1634813105.017100","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qx=x4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4e21b10-7d10-4b7f-aa96-d2d83aa9b7e2","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"皆さん当たり前のように要望しますがこれを実現するのは難しい。\nので、そこまでやってるファジーファインダーは少ない","ts":"1634832333.067200","thread_ts":"1634813105.017100","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B+1z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f458c1cc-abc8-41ba-acdf-d7008dabdeb5","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"なるほど。","ts":"1634832402.067600","thread_ts":"1634813105.017100","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T2sf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"277adb47-b3c6-488a-ad0a-4aa1b646d581","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"そこなんですけど、今思い出したのはファジーファインダーをdenopsで作るとdenopsのロード時間により制約を受ける可能性ががが","ts":"1634830723.048300","thread_ts":"1634812539.008200","parent_user_id":"U776661HA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=/m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a9bee2d-c25e-4665-8e18-7b8f6f4cfd73","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ddc.vimで今陥ってる問題ですね。非同期とはいえプラグインの初回ロードに四秒かかる","ts":"1634830752.048700","thread_ts":"1634812539.008200","parent_user_id":"U776661HA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g2W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"316adbda-f910-45bb-b9cd-dd42b2783084","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"Pythonリモートプラグインもロードは遅いけどここまで時間はかからないのでどうしたものか","ts":"1634830784.049400","thread_ts":"1634812539.008200","parent_user_id":"U776661HA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FVg1O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65a18eb4-d57a-4fad-929b-9182a22799d0","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ロード時間短縮できませんかね？","ts":"1634830929.052200","thread_ts":"1634812539.008200","parent_user_id":"U776661HA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tVA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e39a604d-16cb-40e0-9756-a2e8e02a12d9","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"denops コンパイルしたりすると早くなったりするのかな？","ts":"1634832394.067400","thread_ts":"1634812539.008200","parent_user_id":"U776661HA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ruP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb956c16-b347-4fa3-992a-621a2f908744","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"ボトルネックが Deno のプロセス起動とかだと無理ゲーそうですが","ts":"1634832412.067800","thread_ts":"1634812539.008200","parent_user_id":"U776661HA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T/Tw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dbcf2101-5cfc-4d8d-af19-4e9982e191b6","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"私もファジーファインダーで代用できると思ってましたがファジーファインダーは重いんで、素のコマンドラインの軽さに勝てないですね","ts":"1634830547.043500","thread_ts":"1634812375.004400","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n=sXo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a732d49-1818-4b8a-9a08-f50749df7fe7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"なるほど、そんな問題が","ts":"1634830586.044500","thread_ts":"1634812375.004400","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iY2te"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21128d61-2819-4032-bca9-db5b7719a2cf","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"軽さはとても大事で、wilderはUIがなんか重いのも好きになれなかった","ts":"1634830623.045100","thread_ts":"1634812375.004400","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3jRW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"070badc3-e91e-4b45-9ec3-67bb8dda00d9","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ddc.vimの場合、ロードされるまでは時間かかるけどロードされれば快適である","ts":"1634830656.046000","thread_ts":"1634812375.004400","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/rVlN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3504a24-dd12-41cf-b937-3ec4baf29ad0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あの手のUIは確かに軽いの大事ですね、試してみようかな","ts":"1634830666.046400","thread_ts":"1634812375.004400","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PHJTi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50865dbd-f1a2-4b54-80df-389bdd93062e","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"オッ","ts":"1634831801.063900","thread_ts":"1634812375.004400","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HGa5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7cbabc1-7312-4a12-9269-16505d38e11d","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"コマンドラインは実は一番軽いファジーファインダーかもしれないんですよ","ts":"1634831827.064300","thread_ts":"1634812375.004400","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kzk","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"fukaikousatsu","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TgADe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a61b68e-96db-4ded-8a76-15c6ea7c5458","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"非同期にロードされるので、すぐに候補を出すことはできないんですよ","ts":"1634821086.028400","thread_ts":"1634812032.002700","parent_user_id":"U76GA7MFA","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"klj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8f38112-7c59-4ca4-8d32-388d12b2827b","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"逆に私はwilder使うとロードまで待たされるのが嫌だった","ts":"1634821107.028600","thread_ts":"1634812032.002700","parent_user_id":"U76GA7MFA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eoda"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d57f2700-483b-472b-8d81-6b1926d9fd27","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"自分の場合、wilderはほとんど待たされる感覚がないんです。\n単純な設定しかしてないからかもしれません。\n```[[plugins]]\nrepo = 'gelguy/wilder.nvim'\non_event = 'CmdlineEnter'\nhook_source = '''\n  cmap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Tab\u0026gt; wilder#in_context() ? wilder#next() : \"\\\u0026lt;Tab\u0026gt;\"\n  cmap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-j\u0026gt; wilder#in_context() ? wilder#next() : \"\\\u0026lt;C-j\u0026gt;\"\n  cmap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;S-Tab\u0026gt; wilder#in_context() ? wilder#previous() : \"\\\u0026lt;S-Tab\u0026gt;\"\n  cmap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-k\u0026gt; wilder#in_context() ? wilder#previous() : \"\\\u0026lt;C-k\u0026gt;\"\n\n  call wilder#setup({'modes': ['/', '?', ':']})\n\n  \" Use popupmenu\n  call wilder#set_option('renderer', wilder#popupmenu_renderer({\n      \\ 'highlighter': wilder#basic_highlighter(),\n      \\ }))\n'''```","ts":"1634822972.032800","thread_ts":"1634812032.002700","parent_user_id":"U76GA7MFA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I+If"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c60fd108-4071-4706-ab1d-4c80e17678b9","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"マジで遅いと思うけど強制的にロードする機能を作ってみます","ts":"1634826835.033000","thread_ts":"1634812032.002700","parent_user_id":"U76GA7MFA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5ZSNW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"62c990cf-ad80-4375-9d32-710d36bfe866","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"できた、おっそ","ts":"1634827177.033200","thread_ts":"1634812032.002700","parent_user_id":"U76GA7MFA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Gbrb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e271445b-5773-4232-8f5b-57f76058e3d6","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"やはり、それは辛いですよね。","ts":"1634827300.033400","thread_ts":"1634812032.002700","parent_user_id":"U76GA7MFA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LUM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"369ed335-b0d5-48fa-90e2-13c6936bfe9c","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ロードに四秒かかりますよ","ts":"1634827327.033600","thread_ts":"1634812032.002700","parent_user_id":"U76GA7MFA","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j3bB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"22f6adc0-1e7a-4700-b8b0-d07428233656","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"とりあえず、manual_completeすれば強制的にロードするようにしました","ts":"1634828840.035600","thread_ts":"1634812032.002700","parent_user_id":"U76GA7MFA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7sj1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"61e00309-eb1f-402a-8829-92caa97033f0","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"思い出した、wilderはWindows環境でむちゃくちゃ遅くて使い物にならなかった覚えがあります","ts":"1634829974.036400","thread_ts":"1634812032.002700","parent_user_id":"U76GA7MFA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9/v42"}]}]
